<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney reduced its rating on Scholastic Corp to neutral from buy, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- company warned that it expects a loss of $0.70 to $0.80 per share for the third quarter, including a $0.50 charge related to a reserve taken for retail book returns. The company also said it expects earnings for fiscal 1997, ending in May, to be between $1.45 to $1.60, below $1.97 reported last year.</p>
<p>-- shares plummeted 25-1/2 to 36.</p>
</text>
